    "summary": "Use it in your Movement phase, right after a **THOUSAND SONS PSYKER** unit of yours Falls Back. Until the turn ends, that unit is eligible to shoot, or to declare a charge, though it Fell Back.\n\nIf, when targeted, it is wholly within the [Flow of Magic](vsdata:ability/thousand-sons.hexwarp-thrallband.flow-of-magic) of your army, it may instead do both until the turn ends.",
